egForm.p:
 vn. formation from anfann. act of enfeebling; 

enfeeblement: na curfed P. de in n-athis ┐ in n-a. . . . sin,  

LL 228a34 (TTr. 817).

eg.p:
for feraib fedair .i. atairgither e forna feraibh,  

BCrólige 58 n.8. nocha natairgiter cluici fair, gloss on ni 

fertar cluichi, 61 n.8. Cf. do-fairget.
